sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as redis.Store
    participant P as Other writer
    C->>H: GET /events/x?offset=now&live=long-poll
    Note over H: handleRead · parse offset + cursor
    H->>S: ReadPage → root snapshot + bounded ZRANGEBYLEX
    S-->>H: empty — caller is at the tail
    Note over H: at tail → WaitForMessages
    H->>S: WaitForMessages · SUBSCRIBE ds:notify
    Note over S: re-read once to close the missed-wakeup race
    P->>S: POST append → append.lua PUBLISH 'a'
    S-->>H: wake
    H->>S: ReadPage · capture a new tail snapshot
    loop bounded pages to that tail
        S-->>H: frame-aligned page
        H-->>C: write page and flush
    end
    Note over H: no append before timeout → 204 No Content
